{"id":"word:hebrew:H4581","type":"word","title":"מָעוֹז","subtitle":"H4581 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a fortified place; figuratively, a defence","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מָעוֹז (H4581) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 37 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מָעוֹז (mâʻôwz) means a fortified place; figuratively, a defence First listed occurrence: 2Sam 22 33."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מָעוֹז","transliteration":"mâʻôwz","pronunciation":"maw-oze'","strong":"H4581","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4581","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מָע֣וֹז","מָע֥וֹז","מָעוּזִּ֖/י","וּ/לְ/מָע֖וֹז","בְּ/מָעוֹז֙"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc",6],["HNcmsa",5],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",3],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",3],["HR/Ncmsc",2],["HTd/Ncmsa",2],["HNcmpa",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",2],["HC/R/Ncmsa",1],["HNcmsc/Sp3fs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a fortified place; figuratively, a defence","usage":"force, fort(-ress), rock, strength(-en), (× most) strong (hold).","full":"H4581. maoz or mauz or maoz or mauz מָעוֺז noun masculine Judg 6:26 place or means of safety, protection ( ᵑ0 suffixes as if from עזז , but probably erroneous, compare Buhl Lex 13 Ges § 85k ); — ׳מ absolute 6:26 +, construct Isa 30:2 +; suffix מָעוּזִי 2Sam 22:33 (but read הַמְּאַזְּרֵנִי as || Psa 18:33 ), מָעוּזִּי 31:3 +, מָעֻזִּי Isa 27:5 +, מָעוּזּוֺ Psa 52:9 +, מָעֻזֹּה Dan 11:10 , etc. (read probably מְעוֺזִּי , etc.); plural מָעֻזִּים 11:38 ; 11:39 , suffix מָעֻזְּנֶיהָ Isa 23:11 , read מָעֻזֶּיהָ (Ges § 20o Che Heb.Hpt. and others; strike out dagesh forte in all, see above); — 1 literally place of safety Judg 6:26 , hence (c. collateral idea of strength , as if from עזז = fastness Isa 23:11 , 14 (in 23:14 Che Heb.Hpt. proposes מְחוֺזְכֶם your city ), Ezek 24:25 ; 30:15 ; Dan 11:7 , 10 , 19 , הַמּ ׳הַמִּקְדָּשׁ 11:31 , מָעֻזִּים מִבְצְרֵי 11:39 ; ׳מ הַיָּם i.e. harbour Isa 23:4 , but strike out O1 Du Che Hpt .; ׳מ מֵאוֺיֵב Nahum 3:11 ; compare מ ׳עָרֵי Isa 17:9 . 2. a. figurative, of God ( ׳י ) as refuge Nahum 1:7 ; Psa 27:1 ; 31:5 ; 37:39 ; 52:9 ; Isa 25:4 (twice in verse); Joel 4:16, ׳י וּמְנוּסִי וּמָעֻזִּי עֻזִּי Jer 16:19 , ׳מ מְשִׁיחוֺ יְשׁוּעוֺת Psa 28:8 (|| עָזֿ ); so מ ׳צוּר Isa 17:10 ; Psa 31:3 , מ ׳אֱלֹהֵי 43:2 ; also בְּמָעֻזִּי יַחֲזֵק Isa 27:5 let him lay hold of my refuge (me as refuge); cf . י ׳חֶדְוַת מָעֻזְּכֶם הִיא Neh 8:10 , ׳מ י דֶּרֶךְ ׳לַתֹּם Prov 10:29 . b. of a heathen god , מָעֻזִּים אֱלוֺהַּ Dan 11:38 (read מְחֹזִים cities Che Isa 23:1 ,Heb.Hpt. ). 3 figurative of human protection , ׳מ מַּרְעֹה Isa 30:2-3 ,(both || מִצְרַיִם צֵּל ); מ ׳אֶפְרַיִם ראֹשִׁי Psa 60:9 = 108:9 , i.e. my helmet; also (of angel) Dan 11:1 (|| מַחֲזִיק ). עֲוִיל see II. עול . below","rootNote":"(also מָעוּז ); or מָעֹז (also מָעֻז ; from 5810 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Sam 22 33","keyReferences":["2Sam 22 33","Dan 11 1","Dan 11 7","Dan 11 10","Dan 11 10","Dan 11 19","Dan 11 31","Dan 11 38"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":37,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Sam 22 33","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מָעוּזִּ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Dan 11 1","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/לְ/מָע֖וֹז","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Dan 11 7","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/מָעוֹז֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Dan 11 10","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מעז/ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Dan 11 10","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מָעֻזּֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Dan 11 19","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":19,"englishText